{"id":"n77582-1-6","stage":5,"title":"천생연분 · 天作之合","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n77582-1-6-1","ko":"남편과 운명적으로 사랑에 빠졌다면서?","zh":"听说你和丈夫是命中注定的恋人？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"남편과","meaning":"丈夫，老公","explanation":"남편：丈夫，老公；과：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"남편","audio":"/audio/a4e8e584126026d6f8a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31919","senseId":"1","lemma":"남편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남편과","audio":"/audio/9a2fa3595daf8708e9e5.mp3"}},{"text":"운명적으로","meaning":"命运的，命里注定的","explanation":"운명적：命运的，命里注定的；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"운명적","audio":"/audio/c69327199ef642e728f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68816","senseId":"1","lemma":"운명적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운명적으로","audio":"/audio/f468d01f3027735464bd.mp3"}},{"text":"사랑에","meaning":"爱人","explanation":"사랑：爱人；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"사랑","audio":"/audio/ff2763f11c21f16783f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66649","senseId":"5","lemma":"사랑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사랑에","audio":"/audio/804eed47208a0965bac2.mp3"}},{"text":"빠졌다면서?","meaning":"沉迷，沉浸，坠入","explanation":"빠지다：沉迷，沉浸，坠入；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"빠지다","audio":"/audio/f1cb0821aeeaddd3adf4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71273","senseId":"5","lemma":"빠지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빠졌다면서","audio":"/audio/2c4b0e59cf35f9074004.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a4e8e584126026d6","term":"남편","zh":"丈夫，老公","audio":"/audio/a4e8e584126026d6f8a8.mp3","entryId":"31919","definition":"夫妻关系中的男人。","pronunciation":["남편"]},{"id":"c69327199ef642e7","term":"운명적","zh":"命运的，命里注定的","audio":"/audio/c69327199ef642e728f2.mp3","entryId":"68816","definition":"命运已经定好的。","pronunciation":["운ː명적"]},{"id":"ff2763f11c21f167","term":"사랑","zh":"爱人","audio":"/audio/ff2763f11c21f16783f8.mp3","entryId":"66649","definition":"非常喜欢和珍惜的人。","pronunciation":["사랑"]},{"id":"f1cb0821aeeaddd3","term":"빠지다","zh":"沉迷，沉浸，坠入","audio":"/audio/f1cb0821aeeaddd3adf4.mp3","entryId":"71273","definition":"精神过度地倾注于某处。","pronunciation":["빠ː지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/111d4c088f3faba4ed57.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n77582-1-6-2","ko":"응. 서로 천생연분을 만났다고 생각했어.","zh":"对。我们觉得彼此就是天造地设的一对。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"서로","meaning":"互相，相互","explanation":"서로：互相，相互。","readings":[{"term":"서로","audio":"/audio/fbeb53408bcf7039778f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66374","senseId":"1","lemma":"서로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서로","audio":"/audio/fbeb53408bcf7039778f.mp3"}},{"text":"천생연분을","meaning":"天作之合，天生一对","explanation":"천생연분：天作之合，天生一对；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"천생연분","audio":"/audio/c3c3c8aabdd439593028.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77582","senseId":"1","lemma":"천생연분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"천생연분을","audio":"/audio/9e7540bbd55f647e6224.mp3"}},{"text":"만났다고","meaning":"遇到","explanation":"만나다：遇到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"9","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만났다고","audio":"/audio/8d9bc82a668335d57abf.mp3"}},{"text":"생각했어.","meaning":"认为，当作","explanation":"생각하다：认为，当作；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"생각하다","audio":"/audio/6ffd015ff4c3322ac70c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66376","senseId":"7","lemma":"생각하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각했어","audio":"/aud